72d4824944e7afbce3b3f05516fd2e4166efd44e25b3330baa3b0363" "q-24641/selection/67938324c579955c5d4dea65b3b0edf3f2fb3ee0e6dad07302dde7bdb55449c1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-24641" :question/id #uuid "22afbe88-21e1-5527-b502-0186c79debd2" :question/math-academy-id "q-24641" :question/problem "$\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡{60}^{∘}\\operatorname{cot}⁡{30}^{∘}-1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘}}=$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for sine: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={30}^{∘}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot {30}^{∘}) & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘}\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘} \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡({60}^{∘}) & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘}\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can rewrite the given expression using the above, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡{60}^{∘}\\operatorname{cot}⁡{30}^{∘}-1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘}} & =\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘}\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘}\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘}}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘}}-1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2{cos}^{2}⁡{30}^{∘}-1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡{30}^{∘}-1+{cos}^{2}⁡{30}^{∘}}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡{30}^{∘}-(1-{cos}^{2}⁡{30}^{∘})}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing  the Pythagorean identity in the form ${sin}^{2}⁡{30}^{∘}=1-{cos}^{2}⁡{30}^{∘},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡{30}^{∘}-(1-{cos}^{2}⁡{30}^{∘})}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘}} & =\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡{30}^{∘}-{sin}^{2}⁡{30}^{∘}}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘}+\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘})(\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘})}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘}+\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘})\\cancel{(\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘})}}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘}}} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡{30}^{∘}+\\operatorname{sin}⁡{30}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-24641/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5f9683d9-05b9-5a42-9f81-0170a15dfac1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-24641"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-76641/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer/id #uuid "66d5ed59-acae-5814-88a2-c001856f340b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76641/selection/e014eef6d5b5b99f76a63badf4d7e4589d1524a951e6f15c41809dcf478e3da9" :answer/id #uuid "2b8bba33-5efc-5664-abb1-64164441b219" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76641/selection/ac9362c9c743a0d4cd03c825418c9d77629147a5815c12295606faadbe8a8744" :answer/id #uuid "9a468535-3fdd-5b63-96c6-d15132632f9a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76641/selection/2edf353dc47d221855e5e7ee4be942392390ff01766e089c29dc368c2051b12d" :answer/id #uuid "2a45e51d-f70a-5874-b11a-869458395675" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76641/selection/e7f6c27482797e11bd6b0013338edc6789517ab47eb94f4fe9912fc5f8b6c4b8" :answer/id #uuid "e5275784-6a42-5d5e-8e9a-769842fb3714" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/valida