\\operatorname{cos}⁡{50}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120029/selection/d4a3545822702e067cd2d397d26ef02ef0ad1728971089b53e625711deeee359" :answer/id #uuid "023f9a63-2f22-5145-94fb-5736a13bae5a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡{50}^{∘}-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120029/selection/01ef43ce691aa39a7482c259ff29647cd701dfdd6edb42b06f1f8ac5bf134d12" :answer/id #uuid "299a4036-7401-5ec0-be7f-2022c81d1096" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1+{cos}^{2}⁡{50}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120029/selection/fa3226d30a9cde0c1778e9a840c484a243f01b4f6c626d6ec9364c2b4f124750" :answer/id #uuid "a1cb1f7d-bc36-5ff9-a3ee-57d48f84ac6b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡{50}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120029/selection/4aec6e3853ae389cb9de4a86743de4e6169f64205c079ee64ab6cdf93feb7dc5" :answer/id #uuid "9d36f77e-f34f-5865-a379-4b6195857bef" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{cos}^{2}⁡{50}^{∘}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120029/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ac5edacb-bfbd-58aa-8234-65a8e4b4cad7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-120029/selection/02cd3a697a9bcc40e6d2957507cdfe6f112d29e2adcfdcdd5cf6e828a740cb30" :answer-field/choices ["q-120029/selection/02cd3a697a9bcc40e6d2957507cdfe6f112d29e2adcfdcdd5cf6e828a740cb30" "q-120029/selection/d4a3545822702e067cd2d397d26ef02ef0ad1728971089b53e625711deeee359" "q-120029/selection/01ef43ce691aa39a7482c259ff29647cd701dfdd6edb42b06f1f8ac5bf134d12" "q-120029/selection/fa3226d30a9cde0c1778e9a840c484a243f01b4f6c626d6ec9364c2b4f124750" "q-120029/selection/4aec6e3853ae389cb9de4a86743de4e6169f64205c079ee64ab6cdf93feb7dc5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-120029" :question/id #uuid "178fb81d-b009-5067-9e70-c3ccaf69f0be" :question/math-academy-id "q-120029" :question/problem "$\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡{100}^{∘}\\operatorname{tan}⁡{50}^{∘}}{2-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡{50}^{∘}}=$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for sine: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={50}^{∘}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot {50}^{∘}) & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡{50}^{∘}\\operatorname{cos}⁡{50}^{∘} \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡({100}^{∘}) & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡{50}^{∘}\\operatorname{cos}⁡{50}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can rewrite the given expression using the above, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡{100}^{∘}\\operatorname{tan}⁡{50}^{∘}}{2-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡{50}^{∘}} & =\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡{50}^{∘}\\operatorname{cos}⁡{50}^{∘}\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡{50}^{∘}}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡{50}^{∘}}}{2-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡{50}^{∘}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2{sin}^{2}⁡{50}^{∘}}{2(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡{50}^{∘})} \\\\  & =\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡{50}^{∘}}{1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡{50}^{∘}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing  the Pythagorean identity ${sin}^{2}⁡{50}^{∘}=1-{cos}^{2}⁡{50}^{∘},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡{50}^{∘}}{1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡{50}^{∘}} & =\\frac{1-{cos}^{2}⁡{50}^{∘}}{1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡{50}^{∘}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡{50}^{∘})(1+\\operatorname{cos}⁡{50}^{∘})}{1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡{50}^{∘}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡{50}^{∘})}(1+\\operatorname{cos}⁡{50}^{∘})}{\\cancel{1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡{50}^{∘}}} \\\\  & =1+\\operatorname{cos}⁡{50}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-120029/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5f9683d9-05b9-5a42-9f81-0170a15dfac1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-120029"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-120088/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "66ebe9bc-0c